prompt_template:
Create one finished premium footwear campaign board.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Case story: {CASE_DIRECTION}
Original shoe mechanism: {SHOE_MECHANISM}
Process order: {PROCESS_BEATS}
Exact micro-labels: {MICRO_LABELS}. Render only these tiny labels and 01/02/03 counters in a restrained clean uppercase grotesk; text must remain small and crisp, never larger than a discreet annotation. No headline, brand or paragraph.
Show the process visually across three ordered states with clear cause and effect, connecting athletic action to a visible change in the shoe. Use a fresh composition suited to this mechanism; integrate one high-impact action image with purposeful sequential process frames or close-ups. In portrait, let the eye travel from action into the three states; in landscape, recompose the action and sequence across the width. Keep generous breathing room and thin panel divisions.
Use premium, believable footwear materials, natural anatomy, sculpted shadow, charcoal/obsidian and warm bone light with restrained deep vermilion on the working structure. Do not recreate or edit the references. Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}.
